{"status":true,"data":{"id":14,"name":"Plane Mod","slug":"plane-mod","mod_id":"PlaneMod","shortDescription":"Adds an usable plane to the game","description":"### How to spawn?\r\nEnable game debug console (type \"cheatstick\" while playing and press F1) than do \"spawnplane\" command\r\n\r\n### Controls\r\nInteract button to enter, G to exit\r\nW & S for throttle\r\nA & D for yaw\r\nMouse for pitch & roll\r\nHold RMB to unlock camera movement\r\n\r\nInteract button to enter, circle to exit\r\nRight & Left triggers for throttle\r\nL1 & R1 for yaw\r\nLeft stick for pitch & roll\r\nRight stick to rotate camera\r\n\r\n### Settings\r\nAdditional settings for camera adjustment and pitch/roll direction in the Mods panel (Pause menu -> mods)\r\n\r\n### Note\r\nPlane position will be saved and shared globally between savegames\r\nYou can spawn a new one at any time\r\n<FONT COLOR=\"#ffff80\">Nicks Mod Menu and/or NoClip mods seems to break this mod causing the player to slide on the ground</FONT COLOR>","dependencies":"","type":"Mod","modSide":null,"isNSFW":false,"isApproved":true,"isFeatured":false,"isMultiplayerCompatible":false,"requiresAllPlayers":false,"lastWeekDownloads":63,"downloads":19228,"latestVersion":"1.1.0","latestVersionSize":"","averageRating":0,"reviewsCount":0,"favoritesCount":2,"commentsCount":1,"sourceUrl":null,"imageUrl":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1767665954305_1696089895323_plane-mod_thumbnail.png","buildGuid":null,"buildShareVersion":null,"numberOfElements":null,"lastReleasedAt":"2023-12-05T21:58:33.599Z","createdAt":"2023-09-30T16:04:55.305Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-29T03:30:00.383Z","userId":4,"categoryId":1,"images":[],"user":{"name":"ImAxel","slug":"imaxel","imageUrl":"","isTrusted":true},"category":{"name":"Misc","slug":"misc"},"versions":[{"id":130,"version":"1.1.0","isLatest":true,"changelog":"Added gamepad support","downloadUrl":"https://r2.sotf-mods.com/1767668244504_1701813513276_plane-mod_1.1.0.zip","extension":"zip","filename":"1701813513276_pl